#. emotion: Warily delivering
msgctxt "speaker:Hecate"
msgid "But people still fought. They argued."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "But perhaps it was the wine, the pleasant conversation, or the man's apparent age."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Suspiciously anxious
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "But perhaps most dangerous of all, enemies are rising from within Rosanna."
