#. emotion: Tense anticipation
msgctxt "speaker:Oryon"
msgid "But soon, the Void will descend on this city, and you will need to be ready."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "But soon, the more she paid attention, Sarah realized that the slavery ran deeper."
