msgctxt "speaker:Marion"
msgid "I will not be made a fool in this marriage."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Firmly rejecting submission
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I will not be some soft queen who will bend to the whims of advisors, or who lives for politics."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Grudgingly accepting
msgctxt "speaker:Gilead"
msgid "I will not beg you to grant you a gift, Sarah."
