#. emotion: Confidently assuring
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I will pledge that I will give you my support, if in turn you give me yours."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Relievedly confident
msgctxt "speaker:Carolyn"
msgid "I will practice with you. When the times comes, you will be ready, trust me."
