#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Vaelen"
msgid "I will sign the order, in my name. There won't be a soldier in the camp that will disobey such a direct order."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Calmly confiding
msgctxt "speaker:Razaphel"
msgid "I will speak only truth from now on, Sarah. I will admit to my deceit, and ask for your forgiveness."
