#. emotion: Annoyed, yet concerned
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I won't be able to sleep at all; I'm too scared."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Calmly reassuring
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I won't be your assassin."
