msgid "I won't lie to you, you're a beautiful woman and I'm sure you've heard that plenty in your life."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: In an earnest, reassuring tone
msgctxt "speaker:Captain Belmont"
msgid "I won't lie, blondie. This started as a bit of fun for me."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Cautiously assuring
msgctxt "speaker:Varga"
msgid "I won't lie. Does it upset you, knowing that?"
msgstr ""

#. emotion: In a hesitant, fearful whisper
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I won't lie..."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Calmly assured
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I won't make that mistake again."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Assertively, with determination
msgctxt "speaker:Marius"
msgid "I won't make you suffer that."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Determinedly defiant, firmly resolved
msgctxt "speaker:Duke Antonio"
msgid "I won't need to sit here and have my loyalty questioned by some usurper."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Detached amusement
msgctxt "speaker:Alaric"
