#. emotion: Solemnly, with sincerity
msgctxt "speaker:Samayra"
msgid "I won't pretend that I'm never sad."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: In a somber, reflective tone
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I won't pretend that this will be easy...Rosanna is a different place, you're right."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Calmly confident
msgctxt "speaker:Sophia"
msgid "I won't pretend to be an idiot, I know most men think I'm beautiful."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Reservedly confident
msgctxt "speaker:Maeiv"
msgid "I won't pretend to be the fool."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Nervously attentive
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I won't pretend your life was easy, but mine hasn't been easy either."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: In a detached, neutral manner
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I won't say anything."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Optimistically hopeful
msgctxt "speaker:Marion"
msgid "I won't spend the rest of my life in a dungeon..."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Worried resistance
msgctxt "speaker:Marion"
msgid "I won't surrender...I can't..."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Confidently, with conviction
msgctxt "speaker:Kate"
msgid "I won't take a vow of celibacy though."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "menu"
msgid "I won't tell Marius anything"
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Firmly, with determination
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I won't walk away."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Detached disappointment
msgctxt "speaker:Xanthippe"
msgid "I won't warn you again, let go of her."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: In an exasperated refusal
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I won't! I won't! Please..."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I wonder if Marion knows how much suffering he's causing."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Contemplatively, with nostalgia
msgctxt "speaker:Sophia"
msgid "I wondered about it when I first got here."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Cassius"
msgid "I wondered where you might be."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Young woman"
msgid "I worked down south in a laundry crew till they fired people cause of end o season."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Alfred"
msgid "I worried for the girl and so I went to see if she was alright."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Samayra"
msgid "I worry about that all the time...but no, you're tough."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Nervously trembling
msgctxt "speaker:Samayra"
msgid "I worry that you will win."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Admiringly acknowledging
msgctxt "speaker:Carolyn"
msgid "I would ask no more of you, princess Sarah."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Warmly, with affection
msgctxt "speaker:Duke Antonio"
msgid "I would be forever grateful to put this matter to rest."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Coldly confident
msgctxt "speaker:Duke Antonio"
msgid "I would burn half my country if I could make a decent enough coin off it."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Garret"
msgid "I would change, but I would wake up having hurt nobody."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Duke Antonio"
msgid "I would enjoy seeing that."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: In a confident, slightly proud tone
msgctxt "speaker:Gilead"
msgid "I would expect consideration in return for my support."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I would expect nothing less of my Warmster."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Warily reminiscing
msgctxt "speaker:Garret"
msgid "I would give everything to get back what I once had."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Warmly, with affection
msgctxt "speaker:Gilead"
msgid "I would gladly wish to hear more."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: With disdain and regret
msgctxt "speaker:Marshal Edmond"
msgid "I would hate if I had done anything to even give life to a seed of it by keeping you here so long."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: In a somber, reflective tone
msgctxt "speaker:Garret"
msgid "I would have done it myself, but all this disaster has found its root in my suicide."
