#. emotion: Cautiously optimistic
msgctxt "speaker:Sigmund"
msgid "I wouldn't do that."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Confidently, with pride
msgctxt "speaker:Vaelen"
msgid "I wouldn't dream of it."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: With a heavy sense of regret
msgctxt "speaker:Xanthippe"
msgid "I wouldn't forgive myself if I hadn't."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Varga"
msgid "I wouldn't hold it against you if you had, Sarah. Those things, where I'm from, it's not something people spend too much time worrying about."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Softly, apologetically
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I wouldn't want to impose."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Warily reciting
msgctxt "speaker:Garret"
msgid "I wounded all those people. I hurt them. I...killed them."
