#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Orcs seemed to enjoy violence in all things, even their sex."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Grimly excited
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Orcs stood up, pounded their chest, and roared."
