msgctxt "speaker-name"
msgid "Other man"
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Cautiously curious
msgctxt "speaker:Marshal Edmond"
msgid "Other matters that might be of greater importance than even this question."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Condescendingly condescendingly dismissive
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Other subjects, such as warfare, were generally not considered required reading for noble women."
