msgid "We could get married..."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Dreamily hopeful
msgctxt "speaker:Atilla"
msgid "We could live in this cave. Just fuck and hunt all day."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "We could sail...anywhere we wanted to."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "We could send a scout party up the road to Ridgehaven. See what is going on there."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Calmly confident
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "We could show her...together."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Cautiously intrigued
msgctxt "speaker:Hecate"
msgid "We could travel back through the jungle, but it would take weeks."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Suspiciously cautious
msgctxt "speaker:Gideon"
msgid "We could, but if there are Tribesmen loyalists or spies, they might report back to the capital."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Alaric"
msgid "We could...but this...this is the only place in Lethram where the City Guard never comes."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Tentatively hopeful
msgctxt "speaker:Sakar"
msgid "We could...maybe go on the road, together."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Contemplatively detached
msgctxt "speaker:Razaphel"
msgid "We couldn't anywhere, Sarah. Always eyes, always ears, everywhere, watching, looking, seeing. Only in this space are we unseen."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Tense, with anticipation
msgctxt "speaker:Mayor"
msgid "We couldn't deny something was going on."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Contentedly reminiscing
msgctxt "speaker:Sakar"
msgid "We deserve a good break."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Concerned yet hopeful delivery
msgctxt "speaker:Xanthippe"
msgid "We did all we could for you, Shah Mahda, but these events are now out of our control."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Triumphant exclamation
msgctxt "speaker:Soldier"
msgid "We did most of the real fighting!"
msgstr ""

#. emotion: In a stern and outraged tone
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "We did not agree to that!"
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Slightly amused
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "We did, yes."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Harshly disappointed
msgctxt "speaker:Man"
msgid "We didn't bring ya here to hear ya yap."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Annoyed disbelief
msgctxt "speaker:Young woman"
msgid "We didn't do anything! We didn't rebel, we're just farming, minding our own business, it's you and yours who come up here and stir shit up!"
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Cautiously hopeful
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "We didn't know who to trust...you included."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Surprised, then disappointed
msgctxt "speaker:Xanthippe"
msgid "We didn't press the issue because we imagined we had more time, but after he made a mess of it, we're now suddenly very short on time."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Warmly, with affection
msgctxt "speaker:Sophia"
msgid "We do it because we want to. Because he's our Khan. And he provides for all of us, really."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Calmly reassuring
msgctxt "speaker:Vaelen"
msgid "We do not turn around."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Earnestly confident
msgctxt "speaker:Xanthippe"
msgid "We do what we came here for. Get into the vault."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Surprised and confused
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "We do?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "menu"
msgid "We don't do that in Rosanna."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Xanthippe"
msgid "We don't expect the Mythran army to reach the palace, but we can't be sure there won't be smaller vanguard units sneaking behind the main front."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Surprised warmly, with affection
msgctxt "speaker:Samayra"
msgid "We don't get many visitors, so it's always nice when I get a chance to show them off."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Regretfully resigned
msgctxt "speaker:Kate"
msgid "We don't have a choice Sarah...I wish we did, but we just don't."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Disheartened concern
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "We don't have any money on us, we can't pay you."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: In a frustrated outburst
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "We don't have any...and we can't make any more while we're stuck in here!"
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Nonchalantly ignoring
msgctxt "speaker:Samayra"
msgid "We don't have to talk about it tonight."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Varga"
msgid "We don't have to talk, but, could you just let me know that you're doing alright?"
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Confusedly uncertain
msgctxt "speaker:Gideon"
msgid "We don't know."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Calmly, reassuringly
msgctxt "speaker:Sigmund"
msgid "We don't mean no harm to you and yours, if you will just let us pass."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Anxiously warning
msgctxt "speaker:Sakar"
msgid "We don't usually take women along on the old road. Too dangerous."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Softly comforting, with concern
msgctxt "speaker:Razaphel"
msgid "We don't want to wake up anyone, Sarah."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Confusedly questioning
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "We don't wear our uniforms? What do we wear then?"
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Xanthippe"
msgid "We don't, not really, but Bagrad and its palace are still home to a hoard of treasures."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Somberly lamenting
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "We don't...we don't have that kind of money..."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Nervously hopeful
msgctxt "speaker:Vaelen"
msgid "We either come apart here and lose everything, or we hold on, just for a moment longer, and reach the other side of this desert."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Attentively anticipating
msgctxt "speaker:Gideon"
msgid "We expect to finish preparin the last defenses in the coming days."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Attentively observing
msgctxt "speaker:Kate"
msgid "We faced minimal resistance coming up on the palace. We arrived here just a bit before you."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Triumphant and excitedly exclaiming
msgctxt "speaker:Voice"
msgid "We found her!"
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Guard"
msgid "We found this...spy, infiltrating the castle supply room."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Attentively reminiscing
msgctxt "speaker:Maeiv"
msgid "We gather again to settle the second matter of our council."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Marius"
msgid "We gather there for important decisions, or when we have a festival, that sort of thing."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Inspiring determination
msgctxt "speaker:Mayor"
msgid "We gather up the men and we head out into the forest and hunt it down. It's not easy, but we've done it before."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Cautiously optimistic
msgctxt "speaker:Merchant"
msgid "We gave the contract to your Spymaster. It states clearly that we only accept transporting the goods, we don't accept to carry any risk!"
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Kate"
msgid "We get there, we make our way into town, and it's busy."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "We give him an option, but it's so fucked he'll draw his own conclusions."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Alaric"
msgid "We go East Lethram."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Vaelen"
msgid "We go to Nauyziri."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Flatly commanding
msgctxt "speaker:Alfred"
msgid "We got some things to get square, so sit your ass down in that chair."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: In a resigned sigh
msgctxt "speaker:Alaric"
msgid "We gotta get off the streets, let the heat die down."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Reflectively contemplative
msgctxt "speaker:Alaric"
msgid "We gotta lay low for a bit."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "We had a garden inside the Castle, but we also had the Royal Hunting Grounds, just outside of the Capital."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Tightly clenched fists, with steely determination
msgctxt "speaker:Cassius"
msgid "We had killed most of the tribes, broken the core cities of their homeland, and we returned victorious."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Neutrally informative
msgctxt "speaker:Captain"
msgid "We had only just gotten started on some basic maintenance and restocking our supplies."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Ephraim"
msgid "We had some private time for the three of us?"
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Warily explaining
msgctxt "speaker:Varga"
msgid "We had to call upon the nobles to raise their armies. The nobles, in turn, raise their armies from the common folk."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: With a hint of pride and respect
msgctxt "speaker:Thomas"
msgid "We have Lord Varga, hero of Northwood, the man who broke the farmer uprising. He will be advising us on matters concerning war."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Alertly anticipating
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "We have a battle to fight."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Neutral observation
msgctxt "speaker:Marion"
msgid "We have a council meeting later today."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "We have a lifetime to learn."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Anxiously hopeful
msgctxt "speaker:Hecate"
msgid "We have a lot of freedom, but sometimes we're called upon to work on behalf of the Order."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Calmly reassuring
msgctxt "speaker:Albert"
msgid "We have a perfectly fine bed we can use. No need for either of us to mess up our backs."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: In a concerned tone
msgctxt "speaker:Vaelen"
msgid "We have a problem."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Atilla"
msgid "We have a whole life ahead of us."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Solemnly, with concern
msgctxt "speaker:Maeiv"
msgid "We have all seen the disasters that can occur when the dispute between nobility and commoner is not settled."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: In a calm, satisfied manner
msgctxt "speaker:Official"
msgid "We have arrived."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Nostalgically reminiscing
msgctxt "speaker:Razaphel"
msgid "We have been before. We can be again."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Reflectively fond
msgctxt "speaker:Cassius"
msgid "We have been in service to various houses over the years, but house Adamos has treated us well these last six years."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Reflectively contemplative
msgctxt "speaker:Dio"
msgid "We have been through more than a few lifetimes of trouble together. Does that not make a bond of similar strength?"
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Enthusiastically anticipating
msgctxt "speaker:Duke Antonio"
msgid "We have communicated through letters plenty, and I must say, I always look forward to each piece of state correspondence."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Reflectively thoughtful
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "We have considered it, and we thought otherwise."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Reflectively thoughtful
msgctxt "speaker:Gideon"
msgid "We have days left of water, not weeks."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Neutral observation
msgctxt "speaker:Thomas"
msgid "We have given them no reason to turn on us."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Admiringly acknowledging
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "We have heard of your good works in helping the evacuation of Lethram."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Confidently demanding
msgctxt "speaker:Xanthippe"
msgid "We have made good on our end, and now we demand you show us the vault."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Voice"
msgid "We have met before, and before that and before that. Again and again we meet. In many lives. But always we end up here."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Attentively, with mild concern
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "We have most of the soldiers here now, the rest can catch up later."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Exasperatedly incredulous
msgctxt "speaker:Marshal Edmond"
msgid "We have need of a strong leader! And you propose in a time of war we put a politician or a merchant in charge? Absurd!"
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Admiringly reciting with warmth
msgctxt "speaker:Lily"
msgid "We have never met, but all the stories I have heard about you tell me that you are a kind and merciful ruler."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Reflectively contemplative
msgctxt "speaker:Ragged Man"
msgid "We have no more words to barter. Take your gift and your warning. Do with each as you please."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Attentively, with a hint of concern
msgctxt "speaker:Kravel"
msgid "We have no report that even guesses at his army, but we know that it has to be quite large."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Surprised, bewildered
msgctxt "speaker:Cassius"
msgid "We have only just gained our freedom, and you would ask us to pledge our lives away to your cause?"
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Reflectively hopeful
msgctxt "speaker:Old Tribesman"
msgid "We have our own God, not your many. So yes, we pray."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Calmly encouraging
msgctxt "speaker:Maeiv"
msgid "We have passed our votes, now we must see to the work that is to be done."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Duke Antonio"
msgid "We have something in writing?"
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Marion"
msgid "We have the Old Houses, most of the Great Lords and even most of the Provincial Lords."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Attentively analyzing
msgctxt "speaker:Kravel"
msgid "We have to assume that they have been routed, or have been forced to withdraw within the fortress walls."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Determined, with resolve
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "We have to do something, Sarah told herself, commanding herself to press on."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Warily observing
msgctxt "speaker:Alaric"
msgid "We have to get off the streets."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Cautiously optimistic
msgctxt "speaker:Varga"
msgid "We have to manage that tightrope."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: With a satisfied smile, warmly, with affection
msgctxt "speaker:Xanthippe"
msgid "We have what we came for."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Triumphant with a touch of sorrowful reflection
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "We have won a great victory today, but this war is not yet over."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Alaric"
msgid "We haven't even been here for the full month...and the stay is not...it's not that expensive."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Gideon"
msgid "We haven't spotted any Tribesmen patrols, but then again, we have been keeping quite close to the shore."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Detached curiosity
msgctxt "speaker:Kravel"
msgid "We heard nothing from them. The reports from the fort dried up a week ago."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: In a confident and authoritative tone
msgctxt "speaker:Duke Antonio"
msgid "We hold all the mountain passes and have long ago turned them into impregnable forts."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Welcoming acceptance
msgctxt "speaker:King-On-The-Outside"
msgid "We hold no anmiosity to you, Star-crowned."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Nervously hopeful
msgctxt "speaker:Gideon"
msgid "We hope so."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Inquisitively questioning
msgctxt "speaker:Sakar"
msgid "We in the business of giving out free rides now?"
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Warmly, with affection
msgctxt "speaker:Man"
msgid "We in this town have been faithful loyalists to your family."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Calmly inquisitive
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "We just...work the shift?"
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Attentively delivering, with a hint of admiration
msgctxt "speaker:Xanthippe"
msgid "We keep informed of the movements and changes of the world. Countless apprentices just like you spend their time writing up reports about some revolution here, or a war there."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Assuredly confident
msgctxt "speaker:Alaric"
msgid "We keep up our end, he can be trusted to keep up his end."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Cautiously intrigued
msgctxt "speaker:Carolyn"
msgid "We kept holding our council meetings, but the truth was, your brother was often distracted, if he was even there at all."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Reflectively nostalgic
msgctxt "speaker:Atilla"
msgid "We laid together every night, and soon after, she was expecting a child. A son, the shamans told us."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Neutral observation
msgctxt "speaker:Alaric"
msgid "We lay off the action for a while, keep our heads down, don't cause nobody no trouble."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Urgently anxious, with urgency
msgctxt "speaker:Xanthippe"
msgid "We leave, now!"
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Atilla"
msgid "We live only the life we live."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: With a gentle and protective tone
msgctxt "speaker:Atilla"
msgid "We live only the lives we have, girl."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: With reverent awe, admiring warmth
msgctxt "speaker:Naydeen"
msgid "We live under his protection, but he values us for what we can offer him return. A softness. A gentleness."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Warmly, with affection
msgctxt "speaker:Marius"
msgid "We look out for one another in this place. I promise."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Triumphant resilience
msgctxt "speaker:Captain Belmont"
msgid "We lost a few days there, but I'll still make a killing off the contract."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: In a contemplative tone
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "We made a campfire and that's when they spotted us."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: In a triumphant tone
msgctxt "speaker:Kate"
msgid "We made it..."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: In an amused, teasing tone
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "We make a handsome couple, don't we?"
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Confidently, with assurance
msgctxt "speaker:Marion"
msgid "We make a stronger union when we represent a united front."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Detachedly amused
msgctxt "speaker:Raza"
msgid "We make enough distance between us and stupid orcs."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Kate"
msgid "We make our way to the inn, it's bustling. Filled to the brim."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Empathetic encouragement
msgctxt "speaker:Naydeen"
msgid "We make our women strong. Teach them what they desire. To speak out their needs."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Attentively hopeful
msgctxt "speaker:Duke Antonio"
msgid "We make trade, and bring prosperity. War is nothing but a drain on a nation's resources, an inefficiency we cannot stomach."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Pensive and concerned
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "We march our men into that desert, there is no telling how many will die."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Somberly resigned
msgctxt "speaker:Gilead"
msgid "We may very well all die together, fools until the end."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "We met here, in fact. This very alley."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Carolyn"
msgid "We might have lost his support...but I think I find myself more sure of you than ever."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: In a playful, teasing tone
msgctxt "speaker:Eula"
msgid "We might make a good lesbian out of you yet."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: In a tense, urgent whisper
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "We might not get another chance."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Protectively concerned
msgctxt "speaker:Marius"
msgid "We might not have all too much here, but that never meant we turn down a stranger in need."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Gideon"
msgid "We move through the hinterlands and come out on the western side of the capital."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Excitedly and urgently, as if discovering something thrilling
msgctxt "speaker:Cassius"
msgid "We moved through the forest with maddening speed, learned the land, slaughtered the natives who did not understand how we Mythrans had suddenly mastered their world."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Attentively, with concern
msgctxt "speaker:Carolyn"
msgid "We must be careful. The soldiers here are loyal to me, but they are more loyal to Mythra. They will report back what they see."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Warmly, with encouragement
msgctxt "speaker:Maeiv"
msgid "We must come together."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Meticulously attentive
msgctxt "speaker:Maeiv"
msgid "We must not rock the boat. Rather, shore up their support and be ready for when we are attacked."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Firmly, confidently
msgctxt "speaker:Marion"
msgid "We must present a single, united front."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: In a contemplative, hopeful tone
msgctxt "speaker:Maeiv"
msgid "We must reform the Union, and put into place a Union King...or Queen."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Attentively, with a sense of urgency
msgctxt "speaker:Gabriel"
msgid "We must wait, exactly because it is so important."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: In a curious, questioning tone
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "We need him to be strict on us?"
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Attentively, cautiously
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "We need to be ready."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Attentively, with concern
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "We need to consider this seriously, Thomas. I think it's fair to say that it's more likely than not that an attack might come from the east."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Thoughtfully considering, with a hint of curiosity
msgctxt "speaker:Carolyn"
msgid "We need to decide on the...practicalities. Who to invite, the meals, the city's festivities. A lot to consider."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Excitedly exclaiming
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "We need to get on this ship, now!"
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Vaelen"
msgid "We need to go there. A secret mission."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Urgently anxious whispering
msgctxt "speaker:Alaric"
msgid "We need to go, before anyone calls the guards!"
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Thomas"
msgid "We need to have another conversation?"
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Calmly assuring
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "We need to help her."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Motivated determination
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "We need to keep going. You need to keep going."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Determinedly, with resolve
msgctxt "speaker:Kate"
msgid "We need to keep moving."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: In a desperate, urgent tone
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "We need to leave!"
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Urgently anxious
msgctxt "speaker:Xanthippe"
msgid "We need to leave, while we still can..."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Anxiously urgent
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "We need to make a decision, and fast, before these two start fighting."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Calmly, encouragingly
msgctxt "speaker:Sigmund"
msgid "We need to make good time."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Warily confident
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "We need to make him proud now. Remember: composure."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Urgently encouraging, concerned
msgctxt "speaker:Kate"
msgid "We need to move fast. Pack enough clothes to last you a few days."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Motivatingly earnest
msgctxt "speaker:Carolyn"
msgid "We need to stimulate strong physical responses."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Tentatively, with concern
msgctxt "speaker:Vaelen"
msgid "We need to talk."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Tentatively, with concern
msgctxt "speaker:Xanthippe"
msgid "We need to talk."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Earnestly determined
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "We need to...we have to..."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Kravel"
msgid "We never had to worry as much, because at most it was the occasional raid from a single tribe desperate enough to risk an attack."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Oryon"
msgid "We occupied ourselves with studies of the stars, and uncovering the laws that govern all nature."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Ragged Man"
msgid "We often find what we're not looking for."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Attentively
msgctxt "speaker:Daemon"
msgid "We only care for a cow because it gives milk. Only care for a pig because it gives meat."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Sakar"
msgid "We only have today. So why not make the most of it. Don't you agree?"
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Eagerly inspired
msgctxt "speaker:Xanthippe"
msgid "We operate on the scope of the whole world, Sarah. We measure not the years but the centuries. Our duty is towards the whole of the human race."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Calmly contemplative
msgctxt "speaker:Carolyn"
msgid "We ought to retire for the evening, if only to save our strength for tomorrow."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Tentatively hopeful
msgctxt "speaker:Carolyn"
msgid "We ought to retire for the evening, though we're far from done I'm afraid."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Sarcastically dismissive
msgctxt "speaker:Kate"
msgid "We pass off some bullshit about being traveling traders to avoid suspicion."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Warily instructing, as if under duction
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "We play it safe, don't stay too long, hit a few stalls hard and fast, get out before anyone knows anything."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: In a hopeful, earnest plea
msgctxt "speaker:Damian"
msgid "We pray only that you allow us to continue on our quest to rid these provinces of bandits."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Eagerly excited
msgctxt "speaker:Both"
msgid "We promise!"
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Determinedly, with resolve
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "We promised them that we would protect them. Even if that only means allowing them to run away, or giving them enough time to safely surrender...we promised!"
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Suspiciously hopeful
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "We promised tonight...only tonight..."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Meticulously detailed, with academic interest
msgctxt "speaker:Razaphel"
msgid "We pulled them, deep from void of the underworld, as a means of fighting back."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "menu"
msgid "We ready the army; best we be prepared."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Serenely confident
msgctxt "speaker:Kate"
msgid "We received a report today."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: In a cautious, somewhat skeptical tone
msgctxt "speaker:Kravel"
msgid "We received nothing definitive, but they say there are hints of a large troop movement."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Attentively observing
msgctxt "speaker:Lily"
msgid "We sat around a map for nearly a week, drawing lines until finally we managed a divison both could live with."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Reflective and peaceful
msgctxt "speaker:Kate"
msgid "We sat in front of that fire for hours...just talking."
msgstr ""

