#. emotion: In a decisive, confident tone
msgctxt "speaker:Captain Belmont"
msgid "Yeah, I'll get to seein about that too."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Affirmatively, with respect
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Yeah, I'll grant you that one."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Reflectively contemplative
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Yeah, I'm alone."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: In a warm, embracing tone
msgctxt "speaker:Lily"
msgid "Yeah, I'm coming along."
