#. emotion: Detachedly amused
msgctxt "speaker:Captain Belmont"
msgid "Yeah, all kinds of people go around thinkin wherever they are is the center of the world."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Inquisitively impressed
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Yeah, as good as I could get, all things considered."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Captain Belmont"
msgid "Yeah, blondie. I'd caught him spying on me a few times. He's not as clever as he thinks he is."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Captain Belmont"
msgid "Yeah, blondie?"
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Attentively curious
msgctxt "speaker:Male Soldier"
msgid "Yeah, but I ain't in a rush."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Nodding in agreement
msgctxt "speaker:Varga"
msgid "Yeah, but Orwen I get. He's like me."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Calmly conclusive
msgctxt "speaker:Kate"
msgid "Yeah, but still."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Lily"
msgid "Yeah, but that was before I heard the news."
