#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Yeah, but you understand, don't you?"
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Lily"
msgid "Yeah, but-"
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Yeah, but-"
