#. emotion: In a resigned sigh
msgctxt "speaker:Alaric"
msgid "Yeah, of course. Why? You thought I'd pawn it off first chance I got?"
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Reflectively content
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Yeah, on a good day it's no different than all the sand you can see here, just a whole world covered in white."
