#. emotion: Casually inviting, with a hint of amusement
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Yeah, right. We can go back and drink wine if you want."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Yeah, she always liked small things."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Kate"
