#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Yeah, what did you think?"
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Yeah, what have you been up to? Surely you got a good story or two?"
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Yeah, what's your story? How did you end up here?"
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Amusedly exclamatory
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Yeah, whatever!"
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Kate"
msgid "Yeah, whatever. Is that like a fancy way of saying soldier in Mythran?"
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Confidently amused
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Yeah, when it's fun. Not when you're actually being mean to me."
