#. emotion: Admiringly approving
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Yeah, you're a lot better at it than me, that's for sure."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Confidently acknowledging
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Yeah, you're right."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Warmly, with respect
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Yeah, you're right. But in the middle of a fight, it can be hard to stay focussed."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Yeah, your dad told me to speak to Jacob about getting started, but he...well, you heard him."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Softly affirming
msgctxt "speaker:Alaric"
msgid "Yeah."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Softly affirming
msgctxt "speaker:Cassius"
msgid "Yeah."
msgstr ""

#. emotion: Softly affirming
msgctxt "speaker:Ephraim"
msgid "Yeah."
